# ALLOWLIST (fix roadmap F3, 2026-09-24): the sidecar image build context is exactly what
# harness/perception-image/Dockerfile COPYs — nothing else. A denylist leaked every new tree
# (runs/ traces are DUA; atomtasks*/ are tens of GB) into docker's small loopback storage.
*
!perception
!data_task/families
!data_task/family_alias.yaml
!harness/perception-image
# the v0.3 perception service (src/medomni/perception/sidecar/Dockerfile; BuildKit reads its own
# Dockerfile.dockerignore, the legacy builder reads this file)
!pyproject.toml
!src/medomni/__init__.py
!src/medomni/core
!src/medomni/perception
!core/families
# inside the allowed trees: never ship runtime state
perception/var
**/__pycache__
